		(property "Design Note" "Fitted damped analog prefilter; the footprint may still take 0R or a characterized bead after bench validation. Was 0805 SOLELY to keep the bead option open, and it was the only 0805 resistor on the board. 0603 ferrite beads are as available as 0805 (Murata BLM18, TDK MPZ1608), so the option survives the change while R_0805_2012Metric leaves the board and 10R merges into the one 0603 line with R2/R3"
