		(property "Design Note" "CE monitor divider bottom leg. 200k total keeps the load on A1's output at ~16 uA of its 750 uA drive spec; a 10k pair would take 144 uA. The value is set by the ADC's 50 kohm max source impedance AT TOLERANCE, not by the load"
