		(property "Design Note" "VREF health diagnostic divider, 1:2 into ADS1119 AIN1 measured against the chip's INTERNAL 2.048V reference, so 2.500V arrives as 1.250V. FIRMWARE: VREF_MON_MV = 2 x ADC. 0.1%/25ppm thin film is the right grade -- the ADS1119 internal reference is itself 0.2% and ~25ppm/C, so a 0.05%/10ppm part (10x the price) would be measuring behind a coarser ruler"
