				(justify mirror)
			)
		)
		(property "Design Note" "Cathode HF decoupling, deliberately SMALL. AZ431-A Figure 15 (stability boundary vs load capacitance, VKA=VREF curve) shows two stable regions with an unstable band between them; at our ~1.6 mA cathode current the lower stable region runs to roughly 10 nF. 1 n sits well inside it. The bulk capacitance is C10, held OFF the cathode by R31 on purpose -- DO NOT move a microfarad-scale cap onto this node, and do not raise this value, without re-reading that figure. Chart reading, not a specified number: confirm on the bench before release"
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "B.SilkS")
